LargeLetter: A strange character from an unknown land. They travel constantly in an attempt to track down odds and ends from across the lands. They make a business of selling these strange artifacts and costumes.
OlympianDragon: As chaotic forces enthralled their brethen, some dragons sought refuge with the Seraph Queen. In exchange for her protection, they now serve at her beck and call.
Athena: Queen of the Seraphs who never quits. Utterly livid at earthwalkers for tormenting her children she lashes at them with thunderous fury.
SeraphGuard: More magically astute then their lesser brethren, these royal guards protect their queen till the bitter end.
Seraph: Pitiful fowls of the Acropolis, barely able to keep their magic and temper in check they will cry out for Athena at the slightest inconvenience.
OlympianAthena: Pushed to her limits after the fall of the lord of the moon, the goddess bares her fangs to show all that a varian never quits.
AthenaClone: A prime display of the goddess' magical prowess. Brought to life, these clouded clones mimick her every wake.
